 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/nord-gearvm.dtsi | 2848 +++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 2848 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/nord-gearvm.dtsi

